# Minimal copy

Follow `docs/DESIGN.md` → "Minimal copy" and run its review checklist.

- Let layout, hierarchy, spacing and one clear primary action explain the screen.
- No eyebrows, restating subtitles, slogans, tutorial paragraphs or per-section help.
- Optional context: `InfoTip` (accessible button + tooltip), not always-visible text.
- Keep form labels, accessible names and error/status messages.
- Destructive or irreversible actions keep a visible consequence warning and confirmation.
- Plain everyday words, text buttons over ambiguous icons.
